,\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"\\u201cMulti-layered packaging\\u201d(MLP) means any material used or to be used for packaging and having at least one layer of plastic as the main ingredients in combination with one or more layers of materials such as paper, paper board, polymeric materials, metalized layers or aluminium foil, either in the form of a laminate or co-extruded structure.\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"ny\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"virgin plastic means plastic material which has not been subjected to use earlier and has also not been blended with scrap or waste.\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"rigid\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"Rigid plastic types include PET, HDPE etc.\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"flexible\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"Flexible plastic types are LLDPD, LDPE, PP, PE, PS, etc.\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"no1\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"\\u201cplastic\\u201d means material which contains as an essential ingredient a high polymer such as polyethylene terephthalate, high density polyethylene, Vinyl, low density polyethylene, polypropylene, polystyrene resins, multi-materials like acrylonitrile butadiene styrene, polyphenylene oxide, polycarbonate, Polybutylene terephthalate\"],[\"value\",\"Producer\"],[\"value\",\"Importer\"],[\"value\",\"Brand Owner\"],[\"value\",\"PIBO\"],[\"value\",\"EPR\"],[\"value\",\"CPCB\"],[\"value\",\"CPCB1\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"Producer\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"Producer means persons engaged in manufacture or import of carry bags or multi-layered packaging or plastic sheets or like, and includes industries or individuals using plastic sheets or like or covers made of plastic sheets or multi-layered packaging for packaging or wrapping the commodity.\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"Importer\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"Importer means a person who imports or intends to import and holds an Importer - Exporter Code number, unless otherwise specifically exempted.\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"Brand Owner\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"Brand owner means a person or company who sells any commodity under a registered brand label.\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"PIBO\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"PIBOs is an abbreviation for Producer, Importer and Brand Owners.\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"EPR\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"EPR means the responsibility of a producer for the environmentally sound management of the product until the end of its life.\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tImporter means a person who imports or intends to import and holds an Importer - Exporter Code number, unless otherwise specifically exempted.\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tBrand owner means a person or company who sells any commodity under a registered brand label.\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"CPCB\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"PIBOs which are operational in more than two states/UTs shall be registered with CPCB while others shall be registered with SPCB via same centralized portal.\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"CPCB1\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"The following entities shall register on the centralized portal developed by CPCB:\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tI. Producer (P)\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tII. Importer (I)\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tIII. Brand owner (BO)\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tIV. Plastic Waste Processor engaged in (a) recycling, (b) waste to energy, (c) waste to oil, and (d) industrial composting\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tNote: Brand Owners (BO) including online platforms/marketplaces and supermarkets/retail chains other than those, which are micro and small enterprises as per the criteria of Ministry of Micro, Small and Medium Enterprises, Government of India\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tFor details Section 3 & 4 of aforementioned EPR Guidelines may be referred to\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t.\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"category1\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"The packaging category\"],[\"value\",\"I\"],[\"value\",\"II\"],[\"value\",\"III\"],[\"value\",\"IV\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"I\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"Category I is rigid plastic packaging \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t.\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"II\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"Category II is Flexible plastic packaging of single layer or multilayer (more than one layer with different types of plastic), plastic sheets or like and covers made of plastic sheet, carry bags, plastic sachet or pouches \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t.\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"III\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"Category III is Multilayered plastic packaging (MLP) (at least one layer of plastic and at least one layer of material other than plastic)  \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t.\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"IV\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"Category IV is Plastic sheet or like used for packaging as well as carry bags made of compostable plastics  \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t.\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"Targets\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"The EPR Targets are\"],[\"value\",\"PI\"],[\"value\",\"BO\"],[\"value\",\"phase\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"PI\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"Eligible Quantity in MT (Q 1) shall be the average weight of plastic packaging material (category-wise) sold in the last two financial years (A) plus average quantity of pre-consumer plastic packaging waste in the last two financial year (B) minus the annual quantity (C) supplied to the entities covered under sub-clause 4 (iii) of EPR regulation in the previous financial year. \\n\\t\\t\\t\\tQ 1 (in MT) = (A + B) \\u2013 C\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"BO\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"Eligible Quantity in MT (Q 2) shall be the average weight of virgin plastic packaging material (category-wise) purchased and introduced in market in the last two financial years (A) plus average quantity of (B) of pre-consumer plastic packaging in the last two financial years. \\n\\t\\t\\t\\tQ 2 (in MT) = A + B\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"phase\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"The EPR Target shall be determined, category-wise, as 25% in 2021 \\u2013 22, 70 % in 2022 \\u2013 23 and complete (100 %) in 2023 \\u2013 24 onwards.\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"Details\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"Registration details required\"],[\"value\",\"bo\"],[\"value\",\"pro\"],[\"value\",\"FEE\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"bo\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tProof of Selling' of each state (GST, Tax Invoice, etc.).\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tDetails ( type & quantity ) of products produced/marketed.\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tCopy of Consents of Air & Water Acts (if applicable).\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tAny other Information in PDF.\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t.\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"pro\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tProof of Selling' of each state (GST, CIN, Tax Invoice, etc.)\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tRegistration Certificate of District Industries Centre of the State Government or Union territory, if applicable.\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tDetails ( type & quantity ) of products produced/marketed\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t Type & Quantity (TPA) of Plastic Raw Material Used\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t Flow diagram of manufacturing process showing input and output in terms of products and waste generated including for captive power generation and water\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t Copy of Combined of Consent ( Air& Water Act)\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t Details of Storage of Pre-consumer PW within plant\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t Details of Disposal of Pre-consumer PW  \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t.\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"FEE\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"Fees shall be applicable as per the plastic waste generated by PIBOs. For (i)<1000 TPA: Rs. 10,000/-; (ii)1000-10000 TPA: Rs. 20,000/- &(iii)>10,000TPA:Rs. 50,000/-.\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tFees shall be applicable as per the production capacity by PWPs. For (i)<200 TPA: Rs. 5,000/-; (ii) 200-2000TPA: Rs. 20,000/- &(iii)>2,000TPA:Rs. 50,000/-.\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tRenewal fees: Same as Registration fees\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tAnnual Processing Fees: 25% of Application fees ( for PIBOs as well as PWP).\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"Others1\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"\\u201cPlastic Packaging\\u201d means packaging material made by using plastics for protecting, preserving, storing and transporting of products in a variety of ways.\"],[\"value\",\"sheet\"],[\"value\",\"Recycling\"],[\"value\",\"Recycler\"],[\"value\",\"Reuse\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"sheet\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"\\u201cPlastic Sheet\\u201d means plastic sheet is the sheet made of plastic.\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"Recycling\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\" 'Recycling' means the process of transforming segregated plastic waste into a new product or raw material for producing new products.\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"Recycler\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\" \\u201cRecyclers\\u201d are entities who are engaged in the process of recycling of plastic waste  \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t.\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"Reuse\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"\\u201cReuse\\u201d means using an object or resource material again for either the same purpose or another purpose without changing the object's structure .\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"Others2\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"\\u201cEnd of Life disposal\\u201d means using plastic waste for generation of energy and includes co-processing (e.g. in cement kilns) or waste to oil or for road construction as per Indian Road Congress guidelines, etc.\"],[\"value\",\"recyclable\"],[\"value\",\"Management\"],[\"value\",\"Energy\"],[\"value\",\"Pack\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"recyclable\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"\\u201cUse of recycled plastic\\u201d means recycled plastic, instead of virgin plastic, is used as raw material in the manufacturing process\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"Management\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\" \\u201cWaste Management\\u201d means the collection, storage, transportation reduction, re-use, recovery, recycling, composting or disposal of plastic waste in an environmentally safe manner.\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"Energy\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\" \\u201cWaste to Energy\\u201d means using plastic waste for generation of energy and includes co-processing (e.g. in cement kilns)  \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t.\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"Pack\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"Others\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"Details of plastic waste\"],[\"value\",\"PWP\"],[\"value\",\"PRE\"],[\"value\",\"POST\"],[\"value\",\"ENTITY\"],[\"value\",\"RECYCLER\"],[\"value\",\"INHOUSE\"],[\"value\",\"DISPOSING\"],[\"value\",\"PWPF\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"PWP\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"Plastic Waste Processors\\u201d means recyclers and entities engaged in using plastic waste for energy (waste to energy), and converting it to oil (waste to oil), industrial composting  \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t.\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"PWPF\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"The number of PIBOs to engage with PWPF shall be limited by the processing capacity of PWMF as per Registration issued by SPCB/PCC \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t.\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"PRE\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"Pre-consumer plastic packaging waste\\u201d means plastic packaging waste generated in the form of reject or discard at the stage of manufacturing of plastic packaging and plastic packaging waste generated during the packaging of product including reject, discard, before the plastic packaging reaches the end-use consumer of the product \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t.\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"POST\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"Post-consumer plastic packaging waste\\u201d means plastic packaging waste generated by the end-use consumer after the intended use of packaging is completed and is no longer being used for its intended purpose \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t.\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"ENTITY\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"Only entities recycling must register. Recycling means the process of transforming segregated\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tplastic waste into a new product or raw material for producing new product  \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t.\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"RECYCLER\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"PIBO are only liable to fulfill their own obligation, in case of not achieving the target action shall\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tbe taken \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t.\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"INHOUSE\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"You need to register as PIBO and as Recycler both with relevant documentation. Credits can only be issued to recyclers and transaction of credits to PIBO shall be documented \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t.\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"DISPOSING\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"The target obligation is to recycle/end of life, if it is not done, obligation is not fulfilled  \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t.\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"MainMenu\",\"data-conv-fork\",\"first-question2\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"Main Menu\"],[\"value\",\"Back1\"],[\"value\",\"ye\"],[\"value\",\"no11\"],[\"value\",\"category11\"],[\"value\",\"Targets1\"],[\"value\",\"Details1\"],[\"value\",\"Others11\"],[\"value\",\"Others22\"],[\"value\",\"Others111\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"ye\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"no11\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"The following entities shall register on the centralized portal developed by CPCB:\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tI. Producer (P)\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tII. Importer (I)\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tIII. Brand owner (BO)\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tIV. Plastic Waste Processor engaged in (a) recycling, (b) waste to energy, (c) waste to oil, and (d) industrial composting\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tNote: Brand Owners (BO) including online platforms/marketplaces and supermarkets/retail chains other than those, which are micro and small enterprises as per the criteria of Ministry of Micro, Small and Medium Enterprises, Government of India\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tFor details Section 3 & 4 of aforementioned EPR Guidelines may be referred to\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t.\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"category11\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"Category I is rigid plastic packaging.\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"Category II is Flexible plastic packaging of single layer or multilayer (more than one layer with different types of plastic), plastic sheets or like and covers made of plastic sheet, carry bags, plastic sachet or pouches.\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\" \\u201cWaste to Energy\\u201d means using plastic waste for generation of energy and includes co-processing (e.g. in cement kilns)  \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t.\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"The target obligation is to recycle/end of life, if it is not done, obligation is not fulfilled  \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t.\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"Plastic Waste Processors\\u201d means recyclers and entities engaged in using plastic waste for energy (waste to energy), and converting it to oil (waste to oil), industrial composting  \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t.\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"The number of PIBOs to engage with PWPF shall be limited by the processing capacity of PWMF as per Registration issued by SPCB/PCC \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t.\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"Pre-consumer plastic packaging waste\\u201d means plastic packaging waste generated in the form of reject or discard at the stage of manufacturing of plastic packaging and plastic packaging waste generated during the packaging of product including reject, discard, before the plastic packaging reaches the end-use consumer of the product \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t.\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"Post-consumer plastic packaging waste\\u201d means plastic packaging waste generated by the end-use consumer after the intended use of packaging is completed and is no longer being used for its intended purpose \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t.\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"Only entities recycling must register. Recycling means the process of transforming segregated\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tplastic waste into a new product or raw material for producing new product  \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t.\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"PIBO are only liable to fulfill their own obligation, in case of not achieving the target action shall\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tbe taken \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t.\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"You need to register as PIBO and as Recycler both with relevant documentation. Credits can only be issued to recyclers and transaction of credits to PIBO shall be documented \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t.\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"The following entities shall register on the centralized portal developed by CPCB:\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tI. Producer (P)\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tII. Importer (I)\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tIII. Brand owner (BO)\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tIV. Plastic Waste Processor engaged in (a) recycling, (b) waste to energy, (c) waste to oil, and (d) industrial composting\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tNote: Brand Owners (BO) including online platforms/marketplaces and supermarkets/retail chains other than those, which are micro and small enterprises as per the criteria of Ministry of Micro, Small and Medium Enterprises, Government of India\\nFor details Section 3 & 4 of aforementioned EPR Guidelines may be referred to\\n.\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"Category I is rigid plastic packaging \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t.\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"Category II is Flexible plastic packaging of single layer or multilayer (more than one layer with different types of plastic), plastic sheets or like and covers made of plastic sheet, carry bags, plastic sachet or pouches \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t.\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"Category III is Multilayered plastic packaging (MLP) (at least one layer of plastic and at least one layer of material other than plastic)  \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t.\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"Category IV is Plastic sheet or like used for packaging as well as carry bags made of compostable plastics  \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t.\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"Targets1\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"Eligible Quantity in MT (Q 1) shall be the average weight of plastic packaging material (category-wise) sold in the last two financial years (A) plus average quantity of pre-consumer plastic packaging waste in the last two financial year (B) minus the annual quantity (C) supplied to the entities covered under sub-clause 4 (iii) of EPR regulation in the previous financial year. \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tQ 1 (in MT) = (A + B) \\u2013 C\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"Eligible Quantity in MT (Q 2) shall be the average weight of virgin plastic packaging material (category-wise) purchased and introduced in market in the last two financial years (A) plus average quantity of (B) of pre-consumer plastic packaging in the last two financial years. \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tQ 2 (in MT) = A + B\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"Details1\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t>Proof of Selling' of each state (GST, Tax Invoice, etc.).\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t>Details ( type & quantity ) of products produced/marketed.\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t>Copy of Consents of Air & Water Acts (if applicable).\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t>Any other Information in PDF.\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t  \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t.\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tProof of Selling' of each state (GST, CIN, Tax Invoice, etc.)\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t> Registration Certificate of District Industries Centre of the State Government or Union territory, if applicable.\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<br>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t> Details ( type & quantity ) of products produced/marketed\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<br>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t> Type & Quantity (TPA) of Plastic Raw Material Used\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<br>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t> Flow diagram of manufacturing process showing input and output in terms of products and waste generated including for captive power generation and water\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<br>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t> Copy of Combined of Consent ( Air& Water Act)\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<br>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t> Details of Storage of Pre-consumer PW within plant\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<br>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t> Details of Disposal of Pre-consumer PW  \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t.\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"Fees shall be applicable as per the plastic waste generated by PIBOs. For (i)<1000 TPA: Rs. 10,000/-; (ii)1000-10000 TPA: Rs. 20,000/- &(iii)>10,000TPA:Rs. 50,000/-.\\n\\nFees shall be applicable as per the production capacity by PWPs. For (i)<200 TPA: Rs. 5,000/-; (ii) 200-2000TPA: Rs. 20,000/- &(iii)>2,000TPA:Rs. 50,000/-.\\n\\nRenewal fees: Same as Registration fees\\nAnnual Processing Fees: 25% of Application fees ( for PIBOs as well as PWP)\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t.\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"Others11\"],[\"value\",\"sheet1\"],[\"value\",\"Recycling1\"],[\"value\",\"Recycler1\"],[\"value\",\"Reuse1\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"sheet1\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"Recycling1\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"Recycler1\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\" \\u201cRecyclers\\u201d are entities who are engaged in the process of recycling of plastic waste  \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t.\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"Reuse1\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"Others22\"],[\"value\",\"recyclable2\"],[\"value\",\"Management2\"],[\"value\",\"Energy2\"],[\"value\",\"Pack2\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"recyclable2\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"Management2\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"Energy2\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"Pack2\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\" \\u201cPlastic Packaging\\u201d means packaging material made by using plastics for protecting, preserving, storing and transporting of products in a variety of ways.\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"The target obligation is to recycle/end of life, if it is not done, obligation is not fulfilled  \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t.\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"Others111\"],[\"value\",\"INHOUSE1\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"Plastic Waste Processors\\u201d means recyclers and entities engaged in using plastic waste for energy (waste to energy), and converting it to oil (waste to oil), industrial composting  \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t.\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"The number of PIBOs to engage with PWPF shall be limited by the processing capacity of PWMF as per Registration issued by SPCB/PCC \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t.\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"Pre-consumer plastic packaging waste\\u201d means plastic packaging waste generated in the form of reject or discard at the stage of manufacturing of plastic packaging and plastic packaging waste generated during the packaging of product including reject, discard, before the plastic packaging reaches the end-use consumer of the product \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t.\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"Post-consumer plastic packaging waste\\u201d means plastic packaging waste generated by the end-use consumer after the intended use of packaging is completed and is no longer being used for its intended purpose \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t.\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"Only entities recycling must register. Recycling means the process of transforming segregated plastic waste into a new product or raw material for producing new product.\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"PIBO are only liable to fulfill their own obligation, in case of not achieving the target action shall\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tbe taken \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t.\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"INHOUSE1\"],[\"name\",\"category\",\"data-conv-question\",\"You need to register as PIBO and as Recycler both with relevant documentation. Credits can only be issued to recyclers and transaction of credits to PIBO shall be documented \\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t.\"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"Back1\",\"data-conv-fork\",\"first-question2\"],[\"type\",\"text\",\"autocomplete\",\"off\",\"maxlength\",\"100\",\"checkRegex\",\"\",\"name\",\"companyName\",\"data-conv-question\",\"See you later, Please give a feedback. \"],[\"data-conv-case\",\"FAQ\"],[\"name\",\"categoryMain\",\"data-conv-question\",\"Details of plastic waste\"],[1,\"chat_icon\"],[1,\"btn\",\"btn-light\",\"AI\",\"gradientbtn\"],[\"aria-hidden\",\"true\",1,\"fa\",\"fa-comments\"]],template:function(a,n){1&a&&(e.I0R(0,\"div\",0)(1,\"div\",1)(2,\"span\",2),e.wR5(3,\"span\",3),e.C$Y(),e.I0R(4,\"form\",4),e.wR5(5,\"input\",5),e.I0R(6,\"select\",6)(7,\"option\",7),e.OEk(8,\"Ask A Query\"),e.C$Y()(),e.I0R(9,\"div\",8)(10,\"div\",9)(11,\"select\",10)(12,\"option\",11),e.OEk(13,\"Different types of plastic\"),e.C$Y(),e.I0R(14,\"option\",12),e.OEk(15,\"What is plastic\"),e.C$Y(),e.I0R(16,\"option\",13),e.OEk(17,\"Types of plastic packing category\"),e.C$Y(),e.I0R(18,\"option\",14),e.OEk(19,\"EPR Targets\"),e.C$Y(),e.I0R(20,\"option\",15),e.OEk(21,\"Registration details\"),e.C$Y(),e.I0R(22,\"option\",16),e.OEk(23,\" Plastic Packaging\"),e.C$Y(),e.I0R(24,\"option\",17),e.OEk(25,\" End of Life disposal\"),e.C$Y(),e.I0R(26,\"option\",18),e.OEk(27,\"Others\"),e.C$Y()()(),e.I0R(28,\"div\",19)(29,\"select\",20)(30,\"option\",21),e.OEk(3